We've been together It's also like we we have these ideas that love will Triumph and love will save the day and love will smooth over everything And I believe that the base of it has to be that kind of love and attraction and intimacy and all that But the truth is building a life with someone is really you're creating a startup together and to be very unsexy about it like you're creating a company that has its own kind of rules and ethos and you have to hammer out the kind of details some of it if you if you marry Some of it can be a little unspoken like I don't like my wife and I both went to college It's not gonna be a debate whether we want our kids to go to college, you know what I mean?
这就好像我们脑子里总有这种观念：爱能战胜一切，爱能拯救世界，爱能抚平一切波折。我相信感情的基础必须是那种爱、吸引力、亲密感之类的大方向，但事实是，和某人一起构建生活，真的就像是你们俩一起创办了一家初创公司。用一个很不浪漫的比喻来说，你们就像是在组建一家公司，它有它自己的一套规则和企业精神，你必须敲定各种细节。有些事情，如果你结婚的话……有些事情可能不用说得太明，比如我——我和我太太都上过大学，我们想不想让孩子上大学根本不用争论，你知道我的意思吧？

00:19:36.390 --> 00:19:42.907
like that's like kind of baked into our thing, but there are other things I'm sure we'll have to navigate and we continue to.
