So I think this episode is like a really great, especially because I think with a kid on the way or the potential of a kid on the way, those questions take on a new urgency, right?
所以我认为这一集真的非常棒，特别是考虑到有一个孩子即将出生，或者可能即将有孩子的时候，这些问题变得更加迫切了，对吧？

