00:48:36.418 --> 00:48:43.405
Looking back, watching Hymn together marked the start of the shift in my relationship with my dad to the one we would have as adults.
回想起来，一起看《老爸老妈浪漫史》标志着我和父亲的关系开始转变为成年人之间的关系。

00:48:43.405 --> 00:48:48.606
Now, 17 years after watching Hymn with my dad, I resonate strongly with future Ted and his stories.
现在，在我跟我爸看《老爸老妈浪漫史》17年后的今天，我对未来的泰德和他的故事产生了强烈的共鸣。

00:48:48.606 --> 00:48:56.433
I'm increasingly finding myself telling stories about my dad since he died, and sharing who he was because it's such an inseparable part of who I am.
自从我爸去世后，我越来越发现自己在讲述关于他的故事，分享他是怎样一个人，因为这是我生命中不可分割的一部分。

00:48:56.433 --> 00:49:08.621
The memories of watching the show with my dad will always make him a show I keep coming back to, but it's the honest and raw emotion of the characters in the show wearing its heart so openly on its sleeve that makes it so important.
和爸爸一起看这部剧的回忆总是让我对它念念不忘，但真正让它如此重要的，是剧角色的坦诚与真实情感，他们如此毫无保留地敞开心扉。

00:49:08.621 --> 00:49:17.919
You all manage to create something magic by having a comedy show that also demonstrates to everyone watching that whatever you're feeling and experiencing is just so very human.
你们成功创造了一种魔力，通过一部喜剧向所有观众展示，无论你的感受和经历是什么，都是如此真实的人性。

00:49:17.920 --> 00:49:22.829
Thank you so much for creating a show that means so much to me and so many others.
非常感谢你们创造了一部对我以及对这么多人意义重大的剧集。

00:49:22.829 --> 00:49:24.510
Thanks so much Declan, that's really lovely.
非常感谢德克兰，这真的很感人。

00:49:24.510 --> 00:49:26.389
Wow, that's beautiful.
哇，太美好了。

00:49:26.389 --> 00:49:29.309
My God, thank you for sharing that with us.
天哪，谢谢你跟我们分享这些。

00:49:29.309 --> 00:49:30.710
How special.
多么特别啊。

00:49:30.710 --> 00:49:31.550
Okay.
好的。

00:49:31.550 --> 00:49:33.190
Just, it's so humbling.
就是，太让人心潮起伏了。

00:49:33.190 --> 00:49:39.989
It's such an honor that the show could be that for somebody and that they could be part of your memories with your father.
这是一种巨大的荣幸，这部剧能对某个人有这样的意义，并且能成为你和父亲回忆的一部分。

00:49:39.989 --> 00:49:44.510
And then it could be part of your growing up process in that way and that's incredible.
而且它能以那种方式成为你成长历程的一部分，这太不可思议了。

00:49:44.510 --> 00:49:47.690
they should add like a sixth love language to the love language book.
他们应该在爱的语言书里加上第六种爱的语言。

00:49:47.690 --> 00:49:49.610
Like how I met your mother.
比如《老爸老妈浪漫史》。

00:49:49.610 --> 00:49:52.369
Sharing how I met your mother is a love language for people.
分享《老爸老妈浪漫史》对人们来说就是一种爱的语言。

00:49:52.369 --> 00:49:53.210
Yeah.
是啊。

00:49:53.210 --> 00:49:56.969
It never doesn't blow my mind when we hear something like that.
每当我们听到这样的话，我总是会被深深震撼。

00:49:56.969 --> 00:50:02.489
And the generosity of fans to share those types of stories with us means everything.
粉丝们慷慨地与我们分享这些故事，这意义重大。

00:50:02.489 --> 00:50:04.199
Thanks you guys.
谢谢你们，伙计们。

00:50:04.199 --> 00:50:06.599
I am guilty.
我有罪。

00:50:06.599 --> 00:50:08.480
Please equip me.
请把我抓起来吧。

00:50:08.480 --> 00:50:10.800
All sins are forgiven.
一切罪孽皆被赦免。

